# Start: turns_school_training's input.sav (France, Spring 1600, turn 108; England at peace, the
# Europe-bound Caravel held at sea, French units fortified, Quebec Schoolhouse + teacher). Fixture
# edit (sav_json), re-saved through one no-op replay: the three Iroquois villages next to Port au
# Prince ((23,63), (28,61), (31,63)) carry a French Jesuit mission (tribes[].mission 0x11).
# Covers the generous-visit arm of FUN_5bfb (raw 96996-97013): turn 109's Iroquois Brave visit,
# which brought 16 Ore without the mission, rolls (tech 1 + 2) * 2 = 6 > rng(0,15) and sends an
# Indian Convert instead (@INDIANSCONVERT, a colonist with profession 0x1b on the Port au Prince
# tile, owned by the colony's nation). In spring 1601 the convert asks for orders and joins the
# colony (B; rebel divisor +100); turn 110 it works a land tile (food 2 -> 9 by autumn 1601).
key space                  # end turn 108
wait 30
key Return                 # Help: Time Scale (two turns per year from 1600)
wait 10
key Return                 # SoL in Quebec up to 60%: Continue turn
wait 10
key Return                 # price of Cigars rises
wait 10
shot                       # Autumn 1600: End of Turn
key space                  # end turn 109
wait 30
key Return                 # @INDIANSCONVERT: converts join Port au Prince (instead of the 16 Ore gift)
wait 6
key Return                 # King raises tax to 27%: Kiss pinky ring
wait 6
key Return                 # SoL in Port au Prince 12%: Continue turn
wait 6
key Return                 # SoL in Martinique 51%: Continue turn
wait 6
key Return                 # SoL in Guadeloupe 70%: Continue turn
wait 6
key Return                 # Horses cargo ready at Montreal (warehouse full): Continue turn
wait 6
key Return                 # @TRAINPROFESSION: a colonist in Quebec has learned Fisherman
wait 10
shot                       # Spring 1601: the new Indian Convert at Port au Prince asks for orders
key b                      # Join Colony: the convert joins Port au Prince on a land tile
wait 3
shot
key space                  # end turn 110
wait 30
key Return                 # Tupi gift of 6 Tobacco to Guadeloupe
wait 6
key Return                 # SoL in Port au Prince 10%: Continue turn
wait 6
key Return                 # price of Cigars falls
wait 6
key Return                 # price of Coats rises
wait 6
shot                       # Autumn 1601
